-- Real player import: replaces the 100-player mock pool with the actual
-- 174 rostered players + free agents from the current league export
-- (tid 0-7 rostered, tid -1 free agents; undrafted prospects and retired
-- players excluded per GM discussion). Matched/generated by name, not BBGM
-- pid, per this league's history of unstable BBGM ids across restores.
--
-- Clears existing test draft data first: picks/nominations reference
-- specific player rows with no cascade-on-delete from players, so the old
-- mock players can't be removed while any test draft still references them.
-- draft_order/picks/nominations all cascade from drafts, so deleting drafts
-- is enough to free everything up. player_queue cascades from players
-- directly, so no separate queue cleanup is needed either.
delete from public.drafts;
delete from public.players;

